  "reference": "Filemoni 1",
  "verseCount": 25,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "1",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PHM 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inye Paulo, omufungwa aha rwa Yesu Kirisito, na Timotheo murumuna waitu, nitukuhandikira iwe Filemoni omukozi mutahi waitu omugonzibwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Afia munyanyaichwe, na Arikipo omwisherukare mutahi waitu, n'enteko elikuteranira omwawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ruhanga Isheichwe n'Omukama waitu Yesu Kirisito basinge babatunge omugisha n'emilembe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli kaanya ninsiima Ruhanga wange orwo ndikukwijuka omu nshara zange, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ahakuba nimpulira okwo oina engonzi n'okwesiga aha Mukama Yesu, n'okwo olikugonza abakirisito bona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninkushabira okwesiga okw'olikwegesa abandi kube kw'ebikorwa mara kushobore kumanyisa abantu ebirungi byona ebyo tulikushobora kukora tujwangaine na Kirisito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nobona murumuna wange okugonza kwawe kukampa ebyera bingi nk'okummaramara, kuba noshemeleza abakirisito.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niyo nshonga n'orwo ndikushobora kumaza nyemirwemu Kirisito kukuragira kukora eky'olikuragirwa kukora, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aha rw'engonzi zawe nimbona hakili nkutagilize, inye Paulo omubaka wa Yesu Kirisito, kyonkai mbwenu ndi mufungwa aha rwa wenene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninkutagiliza, nintagililiza omwana wange Onesimo. Onesimo ogu mbaire ishe omu kufungwa kwange. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Orwa mbere akaba ataina mugasho ahali iwe, kyonkai mbwenu ntakubeihire natugasha ichwembili, iwe nanye). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namukugarulira, namukutwekera ali wange buchwichwi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakushemeleirwe kwikara nawe k'anjuna ebyo iwe wakunjunire orwo ndi omu kifungo nibantura evangeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai mboine ntakora kantu otaikiliize otaija okankundira aha rw'okugimbwa, onkundire obuzira kukakwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shana rundi nikyo abaire akurugiireho akaanya kake ahanyuma oshobore kuba hamoi nawe ebiro byona, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "atakili mwiru: Yashaagire omwiru, yabaire murumuna waitu omugonzibwa. Omuno ni murumuna wange inye, kyonkai kandi ahali iwe nashaagaho: Ni murumuna wawe aha rw'enshoga muntu mara kandi ni murumuna wawe aha kujwangana nawe omuli Mukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kityo k'oraba nobona ndi mutaahi wawe, omutore nk'okwo wakuntoire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi k'araba yakufakaliire, anga oina eky'olikumutonga, ebyo obitonge inye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inye Paulo nyenene n'inye ndikwehandikira, ndabigira, ntagambire okwo naiwe oina eibanja lyange, eibanja lyange elyo n'iwe wenene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikwo, murumuna wange, ninkutaho Mukama onkolere akagambo aka. Ongaruremu akoyo, iwe murumuna wange owo tujwangaine omuli Kirisito.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninkuhandikira nyesigire okw'orampulira, nangu nimanya okw'orakora ebikizireho ebyo nagamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu kaanya konene ako ontekatekere oburaaro, kuba ninshubira okwo omu nshara zanyu ndabagarukira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Epafurasi, omufungwa mutahi wange alikuturwa Yesu Kirisito, nakukeisa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kutyo na Mariko, Arisitariko, Dema na Luka, abakozi bataahi bange.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omugisha gw'Omukama Yesu Kirisito gube naiwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
